===========================================
The Gimel ID 1.0 Identity Framework (v1.01)
===========================================

::

    Gimel Foundation gGmbH i.G., www.GimelFoundation.com, Operated by Gimel Technologies GmbH:
    MD: Bjørn Baunbæk, Dr. Götz G. Wehberg – Chairman of the Board: Daniel Hartert
